The mod declares the MIT License (mod_license = MIT in gradle.properties, and on its
Modrinth page) but its repository ships no LICENSE file, so no copyright line is
reproduced here. The placement animation in placement_animation.rs follows the mod's
default animation values; icon.png is the mod picture supplied by the user (the mod's own artwork), converted from GIF to PNG.

